  "section": "8.140",
  "rulesText": "When you take the Study action, you make an Intelligence check to study your memory, a book, a clue, or another source of knowledge and call to mind an important piece of information about it.\n\nThe Areas of Knowledge table suggests which skills are applicable to various areas of knowledge.\n\nAreas of Knowledge",
